TensorFold at the upstream revision current on 2026-10-28 and adapted to
NInfer's artifact ABI (the exl3_dense_v1 payload planes, the k-major tile
order via the stride mapping in exl3_dense_dispatch.cpp). The trellis decoder
(exl3_decode.cuh) is a derivative of ExLlamaV3's decoder (MIT,
